      "created_at": "2018-09-07T17:39:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m somewhat new to Sentinels and I couldn’t find an answer to this anywhere…</p>\n<p>I have the game on Android and I’ve been going through the One-Shots for fun, minting the new ones and collecting the past ones.</p>\n<p>Any time I have to reinstall the game or clear the game data, however, my progress is lost and I have to re-attempt all the ones I’ve already completed.</p>\n<p>Is there a way to sync my progress with my Google Play account? Is there something else I’m missing?</p>\n<p>This has happened a few times now and it’s very discouraging and I don’t really see the point of continuing to try and collect the covers.</p>",
