      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-09T15:30:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you clear the game's data, then the game's data is deleted. The Weekly One-shot collection is part of that data.</p>\n<p>It's stored in a file with the game data, and if you back up the game data you can restore it. iOS has native support for backing up and restoring app data, and I think there are 3rd party apps to do it on Android. Or you can do it manually with a file manager.</p>",
